-*   **Output:** The total radiance $L$ at the pixel, comprising the background radiance attenuated by the volume and the accumulated single-scattered radiance [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Output:** The total radiance $L_i$ at the pixel, comprising the background radiance attenuated by the volume and the accumulated single-scattered radiance [S1, unofficial].
 
